===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[figure#Noun|figure]] of [[modern]] [[myth]] [[say#Verb|said]] to [[give#Verb|give]] [[child]]ren a [[small]] [[amount#Noun|amount]] of [[money]] (or sometimes a [[present#Noun|present]]) in [[exchange#Noun|exchange]] for a [[milk tooth]] when it [[fall#Verb|falls]] out of a child's [[mouth#Noun|mouth]].
#: {{ux|en|Anna was concerned that telling her child about the '''tooth fairy''', Santa Claus, and the Easter Bunny would cause him to believe his mother was a liar later in life.}}

